name mapnet-frame-synsets
# README:
#   "- file 'mapping_frame_synsets.txt':
#      mapping between FrameNet frames and WordNet synsets (5,162 mappings)."
# The file has no header row and the README names no column and nothing that stands between the two fields: each row
# is recorded as a pair, in the row's own order. The names after "columns" only point at a position in the row and are
# never recorded.
match mapping_frame_synsets.txt
grammar table
columns frames synsets

claims
pair
subject in frames
object in synsets
